    <string name="p2_ai_prompt_link">Reply in English. Return a link in the form https://motoplus.app/r?d=PAYLOAD. PAYLOAD is the contract JSON encoded as UTF-8, then unpadded base64url (no =). Do not shorten the link. Use v=3, the specified kind and bikeId, only listed part IDs and the specified currency. Replace examples with your results. Also include the same JSON in a motoplus code block as a shared-text fallback. Do not include personal data. Urgency and likelihood must be low, medium or high. Costs are numbers in the specified currency, without separators.</string>
    <string name="p2_ai_prompt_invoice">Ask me to attach the invoice photo in this AI. Extract only completed jobs and their costs. Match parts by ID; jobs without a matching part go in extras with a name and cost. Do not guess amounts: use null when missing. Do not mark jobs that are absent from the invoice.</string>
